      "id": "01",
      "source_unit": "functions",
      "title": "Your First Function",
      "sidebar_tag": "def",
      "description": [
        "<p>Define a function called <code>greet</code> that takes no",
        "parameters and prints <code>Hello!</code>. Then call it.</p>",
        "<pre>&gt; python program.py",
        "Hello!</pre>",
        "<p><code>def greet():</code> defines a function &mdash; the code",
        "inside it doesn't run until you actually <strong>call</strong> it",
        "with <code>greet()</code>.</p>"
      ],
      "starter": [
        "def greet():",
        "    # TODO: print \"Hello!\"",
        "",
        "# TODO: call greet()"
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "stdin": [],
          "expected": "Hello!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
